### List exercises (should return the global library, no custom ones yet)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/5/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by muscle group
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/5/exercises?muscleGroup=CHEST
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/5/workout-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"startedAt": "2026-03-22T12:00:00Z", "notes": null}

### List sessions (should show the one you just created)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/5/workout-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List plans (should be empty)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/5/workout-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ownership check — should return 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/999/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}